Today I solved leetcode question 1281:Subtract the product and sum of digits of an integer.

Description: Question states that we are given an integer and we must add up all its digits and also take product of all those digits.
              eg- 1234
               Sum of digits is 10
               Product is 24
               So our final answer will be 14(24-10).

Solution: First we will create two variables sum and product.
          And we must create a variable num with same value as our integer.
          Then we must start our while loop till our number is greater than 0.
          First we use use modulo by 10 and we will get last digit of our integer.
          Then we must add that integer to sum and multiply that digit to product.
          And then we must divide our integer by 10.
          Then at last we must return the subtraction of product and sum variable.
